            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks again for the PR!\r\n\r\nI ended up incorporating a universal `getreginfo()` approach (setting only `points_to` for unnamed register because it broke updated tests, while `getreginfo()` worked) and having an explicit early return instead of setting `z` register. Plus added tests (although I could not write ones that failed for \"z\" register with the previous approach).\r\n\r\nThis should now be part of the `main` branch.",
