        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "More specifically it seems to be how `vi` originally behaved, but Vim's documentation is self-contradictory. See vim/vim#2346 and vim/vim@9d7fdd403a3a9ee0d008b6dcbcd2ecc9ec0f57b7. The workaround is likely permanently necessary, though Vim's and Neovim's docs should be updated for clarity.",
            "created_at": "2024-08-14T02:31:59Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/pull/1122#issuecomment-2287719431",
