        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> ```viml\r\n> execute \"norm ifoo\\<cr>bar\"\r\n> 1yank z\r\n> lua require(\"mini.move\").move_line(\"up\")\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nYeah, that's not ideal. Thanks for the actual (and small) examples! This is very helpful.\r\nI'll look into this.",
